  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Skin under your eyes is",
        "some of the thinnest on your body",
        "",
        "Blood vessels underneath",
        "show right through it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coffee",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Caffeine acts as a diuretic,",
        "pulling water from that thin skin",
        "",
        "That makes the vessels",
        "underneath stand out more"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coffee — the fix",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Switch to decaf, or",
        "add a glass of water alongside it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Dehydrates you and dilates",
        "those same under-eye vessels",
        "",
        "So they look darker and",
        "more pooled the next morning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol — the fix",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Keep it to 1-2 drinks,",
        "and drink water in between"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Salty Snacks",
      "char_file": "감자칩_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Chips and fries make your body",
        "hold onto extra water",
        "",
        "That puffiness often shows up",
        "first under your eyes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Salty Snacks — the fix",
      "char_file": "감자칩_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap in unsalted nuts",
        "or fresh fruit instead"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      ["Dark circles are usually", "just thin skin plus fluid shifts"],
      ["Cut back on these three,", "and they often look lighter"]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "A full night's sleep and a cold",
      "compress can help too"
    ],
